k City is home to many great Jewish thinkers, and Shaul Feigenbaum found solace in the many rabbinic commentaries and religious texts that some of these men provided through the Chabad-Lubavitch outreach programs. Devoutly observant and endlessly curious, Shaul happily loses himself in the Torah’s most complex mysteries.    <br><br><strong>Professor Kilian Van Doorn of Tilburg</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hyper-punctual and deeply compassionate professor of horology from Tilburg has never felt the so-called self-evident truth of God. With his Dutch directness and twill coat handed down from his late father, the man behind the glasses stands tall as a grounded, open-minded, yet harshly determined critic prepared to call bullshit on any custom, tradition, religious belief, or needlessly vile action at any moment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194520/extras/26a1ab59c3633b55f47dd7db2fe20e58.poster.avif?t=1787689398\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194520/extras/26a1ab59c3633b55f47dd7db2fe20e58.webm?t=1787689398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194520/extras/26a1ab59c3633b55f47dd7db2fe20e58.mp4?t=1787689398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194520/extras/1c117e8c6d4ba1997fd9f7621fe1dfa1.poster.avif?t=1787689398\" width=1170 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194520/extras/1c117e8c6d4ba1997fd9f7621fe1dfa1.webm?t=1787689398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst